  "description_html": "<section aria-labelledby=\"courseDescription\">\n    Prerequisite: MUS 1411 with a C or better\n\nMusic majors only. A development of the fundamental skills of the piano, emphasizing those aspects most useful to non-piano majors. Students will continue to develop skills through performance of scales, chords, sight reading, improvisation, playing in all keys, and harmonizing melodies.\n    \n</section>",
